    "detailed_description": "HACK &amp; SLASH YOUR WAY THROUGH HORDES OF ENEMIES - YOU CHOOSE THE MONSTER DENSITY!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDYNAMIC LEVELS ENABLE UNLIMITED REPLAYABILITY AS THEY CHANGE EVERY TIME YOU PLAY!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCONQUER THE RUINS, THE SEA AND EVEN THE UNDERWORLD AS YOU BATTLE FOR OLYMPUS!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGAIN NEW GOD POWERS AS YOU DEFEAT MASSIVE BOSSES AND VAST REALMS!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUPGRADE YOUR HERO AS YOU COMPLETE LEVEL-BASED TASKS!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSTRATEGIZE WIHCH UNIQUE MAGIC POWERS AND DEADLY WEAPONS TO USE AS THEY RANDOMLY APPEAR AS QUICKLY AS THE MONSTERS!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Story Thus Far...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou\u2019ve been slighted for the last time.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMinor demi-god or not, why should the fools on Olympus get all the praise, all the glory...and all the gold and virgins?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCenturies ago, it is said Zeus stripped the divine essence from all of the gods, consolidating the Pantheon\u2019s power under his grasp.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSince then, the balance of the universe has been lost with no one to challenge the Great God\u2019s will or temper his petty whims. It\u2019s time for that to change.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut to overthrow the godhead, you must amass your own power. Topple the great Titans, destroy the vile demi-gods and slaughter mass hordes to challenge Olympus. For the sake of mortals and gods alike.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill you fulfill your destiny?",
    "about_the_game": "HACK &amp; SLASH YOUR WAY THROUGH HORDES OF ENEMIES - YOU CHOOSE THE MONSTER DENSITY!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDYNAMIC LEVELS ENABLE UNLIMITED REPLAYABILITY AS THEY CHANGE EVERY TIME YOU PLAY!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCONQUER THE RUINS, THE SEA AND EVEN THE UNDERWORLD AS YOU BATTLE FOR OLYMPUS!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGAIN NEW GOD POWERS AS YOU DEFEAT MASSIVE BOSSES AND VAST REALMS!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUPGRADE YOUR HERO AS YOU COMPLETE LEVEL-BASED TASKS!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSTRATEGIZE WIHCH UNIQUE MAGIC POWERS AND DEADLY WEAPONS TO USE AS THEY RANDOMLY APPEAR AS QUICKLY AS THE MONSTERS!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Story Thus Far...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou\u2019ve been slighted for the last time.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMinor demi-god or not, why should the fools on Olympus get all the praise, all the glory...and all the gold and virgins?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCenturies ago, it is said Zeus stripped the divine essence from all of the gods, consolidating the Pantheon\u2019s power under his grasp.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSince then, the balance of the universe has been lost with no one to challenge the Great God\u2019s will or temper his petty whims. It\u2019s time for that to change.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut to overthrow the godhead, you must amass your own power. Topple the great Titans, destroy the vile demi-gods and slaughter mass hordes to challenge Olympus. For the sake of mortals and gods alike.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill you fulfill your destiny?",
    "short_description": "Immerse yourself in a relentless battleground of mythical hordes, divine chaos and epic landscapes. Challenge heroes to gain skills, hone divine powers and take your seat as a god. Will you rise to the occasion, chosen one? Your odyssey has only just begun.",
